            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To raise the fraction to the power of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2,]</span> we must raise both the numerator and the denominator to the power of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2\\mathbin{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{3}{4}\\right)^2=\\dfrac{3^2}{4^2}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To raise the fraction to the power of [MATH: 2,] we must raise both the numerator and the denominator to the power of [MATH: 2\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{3}{4}\\right)^2=\\dfrac{3^2}{4^2}]",
