        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nExpress [MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{3}{4}\\right)^2] as the quotient of two powers.\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTo raise the fraction to the power of [MATH: 2,] we must raise both the numerator and the denominator to the power of [MATH: 2\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{3}{4}\\right)^2=\\dfrac{3^2}{4^2}]"
