            "normalized_html": "<p>To raise the fraction to the power of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3,]</span> we must raise both the numerator and the denominator to the power of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3\\mathbin{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{4}{5}\\right)^3=\\dfrac{4^3}{5^3}]</span></p><p>Now, computing <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 4^3=64]</span> and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5^3=125,]</span> we get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{4^3}{5^3}= \\dfrac{64}{125} .]</span></p>",
