        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nEvaluate [MATH: \\left(-\\dfrac{3}{2}\\right)^3.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, notice that [MATH: -\\dfrac{3}{2}=\\dfrac{(-3)}{2}.]\n\nTo raise the fraction to the power of [MATH: 3], we must raise both the numerator and the denominator to the power of [MATH: 3\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: \\left(-\\dfrac{3}{2}\\right)^3=\\left(\\dfrac{(-3)}{2}\\right)^3=\\dfrac{(-3)^3}{2^3}]\n\nNow, computing [MATH: (-3)^3=-27] and [MATH: 2^3=8,] we get\n\n[MATH: \\dfrac{(-3)^3}{2^3}= \\dfrac{-27}{8}=-\\dfrac{27}{8} .]"
